{"path":"chrono/year/is_leap","title":"std::chrono::year::is_leap","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::year::</span>is_leap","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/year/is_leap","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Determines if *this represents a leap year in the proleptic Gregorian calendar.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> is_leap<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Determines if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> represents a leap year in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proleptic_Gregorian_calendar\" class=\"extiw\" data-external=\"1\">proleptic Gregorian calendar</a>.\n</p><p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> represents a leap year if the stored year value\n</p>\n<ul><li> is divisible by 4 and not divisible by 100; or\n</li><li> is divisible by 400.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> represents a leap year, otherwise <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> <span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">chrono_literals</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year\"><span class=\"kw2636\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year</span></span></a> y <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>2020y, 2021y, 2000y, 3000y<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> iy<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>y<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">is_leap</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> iy <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" is a leap year because it is divisible by \"</span>\n                      <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>iy <span class=\"sy2\">%</span> <span class=\"nu0\">400</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"sy4\">?</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"400<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"4 and not divisible by 100<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">else</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> iy <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" is not a leap year<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>2020 is a leap year because it is divisible by 4 and not divisible by 100\n2021 is not a leap year\n2000 is a leap year because it is divisible by 400\n3000 is not a leap year</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/year","title":"std::chrono::year"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::year::is_leap","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Determines if *this represents a leap year in the proleptic Gregorian calendar."},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if *this represents a leap year, otherwise false."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":163,"codeBlockCount":2}
